<title>CANADA: National Fibretech announces bankruptcy.</title>
<headline>National Fibretech announces bankruptcy.</headline>
<dateline>ETOBICOKE, Ontario 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>National Fibretech Inc said on Friday that the Ontario Court of Justice had approved an application by the Toronto-Dominion Bank to place the company into bankruptcy as of May 15, 1997.</p>
<p>All directors of National Fibretech have resigned, and Richter &amp; Partners Inc has been appointed trustee-in-bankruptcy, National Fibretech said.</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8104))</p>
